### ============================================================
### OrbitaVerde SOA - Testes da API REST + SOAP
### Execute cada request clicando no play verde ao lado
### ============================================================

### 1. LISTAR TODOS OS ALERTAS
GET http://localhost:8085/api/alertas
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. BUSCAR ALERTA POR ID
GET http://localhost:8085/api/alertas/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. LISTAR ALERTAS ATIVOS (nao resolvidos)
GET http://localhost:8085/api/alertas/ativos
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. FILTRAR POR TIPO
GET http://localhost:8085/api/alertas/tipo/QUEIMADA
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. FILTRAR POR NIVEL
GET http://localhost:8085/api/alertas/nivel/PERIGO
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. RELATORIOS (demonstra polimorfismo OOP)
GET http://localhost:8085/api/alertas/relatorios
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. POST - CRIAR NOVO ALERTA (integra com SOAP internamente)
POST http://localhost:8085/api/alertas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipo": "QUEIMADA",
  "descricao": "Novo foco detectado no Pantanal",
  "latitude": -17.8,
  "longitude": -57.4,
  "nivel": "PERIGO",
  "sateliteOrigem": "TERRA",
  "status": "ATIVO"
}

###

### 8. PUT - ATUALIZAR ALERTA
PUT http://localhost:8085/api/alertas/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipo": "QUEIMADA",
  "descricao": "Foco controlado - atualizando nivel",
  "latitude": -3.4653,
  "longitude": -62.2159,
  "nivel": "ALERTA",
  "sateliteOrigem": "TERRA",
  "status": "ATIVO"
}

###

### 9. PATCH - RESOLVER ALERTA
PATCH http://localhost:8085/api/alertas/2/resolver
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 10. DELETE - DELETAR ALERTA
DELETE http://localhost:8085/api/alertas/5
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. LISTAR SATELITES
GET http://localhost:8085/api/satelites
Accept: application/json

###

### 12. BUSCAR SATELITE POR ID
GET http://localhost:8085/api/satelites/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 13. POST - CRIAR SATELITE (via REST)
POST http://localhost:8085/api/satelites
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "LANDSAT-9",
  "tipo": "LEO",
  "altitude": 705.0,
  "agencia": "NASA",
  "status": "ATIVO"
}

###

### 14. RELATORIOS DOS SATELITES (polimorfismo)
GET http://localhost:8085/api/satelites/relatorios
Accept: application/json

###

### ============================================================
### SOAP - Web Service
### ============================================================

### 15. SOAP - CONSULTAR SATELITE (operacao 1)
POST http://localhost:8085/ws
Content-Type: text/xml

<soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/"
                  xmlns:tns="http://fiap.com.br/orbitaverde/soap">
  <soapenv:Header/>
  <soapenv:Body>
    <tns:consultarSateliteRequest>
      <tns:id>1</tns:id>
    </tns:consultarSateliteRequest>
  </soapenv:Body>
</soapenv:Envelope>

###

### 16. SOAP - CADASTRAR SATELITE (operacao 2)
POST http://localhost:8085/ws
Content-Type: text/xml

<soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/"
                  xmlns:tns="http://fiap.com.br/orbitaverde/soap">
  <soapenv:Header/>
  <soapenv:Body>
    <tns:cadastrarSateliteRequest>
      <tns:nome>AMAZONIA-1</tns:nome>
      <tns:tipo>SSO</tns:tipo>
      <tns:altitude>752.0</tns:altitude>
      <tns:agencia>INPE</tns:agencia>
      <tns:status>ATIVO</tns:status>
    </tns:cadastrarSateliteRequest>
  </soapenv:Body>
</soapenv:Envelope>

###

### 17. TESTE DE ERRO - ID inexistente (deve retornar 404 com JSON)
GET http://localhost:8085/api/alertas/999
Accept: application/json

###

### 18. TESTE DE ERRO - POST sem campos obrigatorios (deve retornar 400)
POST http://localhost:8085/api/alertas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipo": "QUEIMADA"
}

###
